["Dumisa Igama leNkosi yakho Engaphezulu.","Lena eyadala yabumba.","Futhi lena eyahlela yahola.","Lena eyenze amandlelo,","Iphinde iwenze ome ashe.","Sizokufundisa [iKurani], ngeke wayikhohlwa.","Ngaphandle kwalokho u Allah afuna ukukhohlwe; ngokuba Yena wazi okusobala nokusithele.","Futhi Sizokwenzela izinto zibe lula.","Ngakhoke xwayisa lapho isexwayiso sinomthelela khona.","Bheka ngoba lowo onokwesaba [u Allah] uzoxwayiseka.","Asishaye indiva lowo ongabusisekile.","Nguyena lona oyongena eMlilweni Omkhulu.","Futhi akayikufa kuwo noma aphile.","Nebala uphumelele lowo oziphathe kahle.","Wakhumbula iGama leNkosi yakhe wenza neSwala.","Empeleni [nina engakholwa] nikhethe impilo yomhlaba.","Nakuba eLizayo lingcono futhi lingunaphakade.","Konke lokhu kwakukhona nasemiqulwini yasendulo;","Imiqulu ka Ibhirahimu no Musa."]